@startuml
state Inventory [*]
state OrderPlacement
state InvoiceGeneration
state Purchase
state BillingProcess [final]
state CustomerRequest
state ReportView [final]

Inventory --> OrderPlacement: OrderPlacementEvent
OrderPlacement --> Purchase: ItemSelectionEvent
Purchase --> Purchase: DiscountCalculationEvent
Purchase --> Purchase: TaxCalculationEvent
Purchase --> BillingProcess: ReceiptGenerationEvent
BillingProcess --> BillingProcess: ReplaceItemEvent or CancelReceiptEvent
CustomerRequest --> CustomerRequest: CustomerRequestEvent
ReportView --> ReportView: ReportViewEvent
@enduml
